<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">18052026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>A drone struck the Barakah nuclear plant in the Emirates overnight, triggering an emergency diesel shutdown at Unit Three.</s> <s>Barakah sits two hundred twenty-five kilometres from Abu Dhabi, within fallout range of Doha, Dammam, and Manama — the first time a Gulf reactor has taken a direct hit.</s> <s>The Emirates named no attacker; the <sub alias="International Atomic Energy Agency">IAEA</sub> opened monitoring and called for restraint.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Ukraine launched five hundred fifty-six drones at Moscow overnight, striking an oil refinery and killing at least three people — the largest raid in over a year.</s> <s>The barrage came days after Russian strikes on Kyiv killed twenty-four, including three children.</s> <s>Zelensky pledged more retaliation as US-brokered peace talks remain unresolved.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan's prime minister Shehbaz Sharif called Islamabad's mediation of the US-Iran war one of the shining moments in the country's history.</s> <s>While Washington celebrates Pakistan as a war broker, opposition leader Imran Khan remains imprisoned and the military's grip on civilian politics tightens.</s> <s>It's the same cycle that's rehabilitated every Pakistani military regime since the nineteen-eighties — security partnership laundering domestic repression.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Balochistan's government stripped fifteen million people of assembly rights for thirty days, invoking Section One Forty-Four — a colonial-era criminal procedure code.</s> <s>The province cited militant threats from the Pakistani Taliban and Baloch armed groups, and also banned face coverings and pillion riding.</s> <s>It comes as families of the disappeared continue their long protest cycle, now criminalised by default.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>France's Epstein probe gained ten new victims as prosecutors target two modelling agents and a recruiter as French accomplices.</s> <s>While the American case collapsed with Epstein's death in custody in twenty-nineteen, Paris is keeping the accountability process alive.</s> <s>No suspects have been questioned yet as investigators review the dead financier's computers and address books.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Egypt's State Security Prosecution disappeared filmmaker Omar Marei for seven days, interrogating him incommunicado and without counsel before charging him with publishing false news.</s> <s>A prosecution-appointed lawyer notified his defence only after the session ended — a pattern Cairo has refined since the twenty-thirteen crackdown.</s> <s>Marei joins thousands held under emergency-era statutes that long outlived the emergency itself.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Peru's election authority confirmed a runoff between Keiko Fujimori and leftist congressman Roberto Sanchez, after every centrist was eliminated in a first round marred by fraud allegations.</s> <s>Sanchez now faces financial crime charges filed by the public prosecutor the same week his runoff place was confirmed.</s> <s>The Fujimori dynasty's authoritarian shadow stretches back to her father's nineteen-nineties rule, and Peruvians are once again being asked to choose within it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>South Africa's ex-chief prosecutor Shaun Abrahams told the Khampepe inquiry he did launch apartheid-era prosecutions — a claim victims' families say is false.</s> <s>The inquiry's probing why Truth and Reconciliation Commission referrals went untried for three decades.</s> <s>Families of the Cradock Four, murdered in nineteen eighty-five, still await a ruling.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The USS Gerald R. Ford returned to Norfolk after three hundred twenty-six days at sea — the longest American carrier deployment in fifty years.</s> <s>The Navy extended the mission repeatedly as the Iran campaign continued, with no scheduled maintenance breaks.</s> <s>Hull availability, not policy, is increasingly the binding constraint on US power projection.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Just one hundred forty-eight used cars entered Pakistan in April — a ninety-six percent collapse year on year, after tariff barriers closed the overseas-Pakistani gift and baggage loopholes that fed commercial imports.</s> <s>Domestic parts makers welcomed the shift as a win for industrialisation, though it raises car prices for households in a country where four in ten live below the poverty line.</s> <s>It's a classic import-substitution bet, taken just as the <sub alias="I M F">IMF</sub> programme demands tariff liberalisation.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nigeria's manufacturers lobby warned the central bank against further rate hikes ahead of Monday's policy meeting, calling the current twenty-six and a half percent rate a chokehold on industry.</s> <s>Energy and logistics costs drive Nigerian inflation, the group argued — rate hikes can't fix supply constraints.</s> <s>Pre-election spending now adds a fiscal layer the bank can't tighten its way out of.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Bottled water has run short across Abuja and Kano as private distributors fail to restock the networks that replaced piped public supply.</s> <s>Supermarkets in Kano sold just thirteen bottles in three days, with customers booking ahead for deliveries that may not arrive.</s> <s>It's the failure mode of privatising a basic utility — when the market breaks, there's no public system left to fall back on.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Serbia and Azerbaijan announced a five-hundred-megawatt gas plant near Niš, with Baku's state oil company supplying the fuel.</s> <s>The deal shifts Serbia's new generating capacity from Russian to Azerbaijani imports by twenty-thirty — a quiet pivot for one of Moscow's last European allies.</s> <s>President Vucic also announced expanded arms cooperation with Baku, including Norwegian-routed deals.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Britain's Prudential bought seventy-five percent of Bharti Life for three hundred sixty-five million dollars, betting on India's largely uninsured middle class.</s> <s>Prudential gains Bharti's distribution network rather than building one from scratch, and will cut its stake in ICICI Prudential Life below ten percent as part of the restructure.</s> <s>It's a wager that India's insurance penetration — still under five percent of <sub alias="G D P">GDP</sub> — has nowhere to go but up.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A Mumbai court fined a railway driver twenty-five thousand rupees — roughly three hundred dollars — for a collision that left a seventeen-year-old in a persistent vegetative state.</s> <s>The Bombay High Court had recommended a fifty-million-rupee civil settlement; Indian Railways refused, and the criminal fine came in two thousand times smaller.</s> <s>It's the structural gap where state actors offload negligence costs onto the households they've already broken.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The World Health Organization declared the Democratic Republic of Congo's Ebola outbreak a global health emergency, with two hundred forty-six cases and eighty deaths from the Bundibugyo strain — a variant with no licensed vaccine.</s> <s>The ruling came without convening an expert panel, an unprecedented step that signals how fast the outbreak is moving.</s> <s>The United States is evacuating exposed Americans, possibly to a military facility.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>London researchers fixed a long-standing failure in bone-drug screening by adding a macrophage colony-stimulating factor priming step to stem-cell differentiation.</s> <s>The change pushed osteoclast yields above seventy percent across three independent cell lines, and primed cells responded predictably to osteoporosis drugs.</s> <s>It's the kind of methodological fix that quietly unblocks years of stalled drug discovery.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nepal's farmers are stabilising eroding riverbanks with biodykes — woven vegetation barriers — as erratic rainfall reshapes the Himalayan foothills.</s> <s>Less than one percent of global climate finance reaches indigenous peoples, who bear the heaviest flood, drought, and landslide risk.</s> <s>Whether donor capital ever reaches the stewards doing the work remains the unanswered question of climate adaptation.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>IBM's one-hundred-twenty-seven-qubit Brisbane processor generated certifiable randomness without a photonic rig, passing the National Institute of Standards and Technology benchmark for cryptographic key material.</s> <s>It's the first time a general-purpose quantum machine has cleared that bar, and IBM is now offering the capability as a cloud service.</s> <s>Whether buyers trust a quantum black box for their keys is the next question.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Stronger spacecraft materials are making orbital debris worse, not better, because reinforced structures survive reentry instead of burning up.</s> <s>The nineteen seventy-two Outer Space Liability Convention assigns fault for falling debris but provides no mechanism to identify which operator it came from.</s> <s>Populations living below high-traffic orbital corridors carry a risk no treaty currently addresses, God willing it stays theoretical.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan moved passport fees to QR-code payments by the end of June, replacing the informal agents who charged unofficial fees at passport offices.</s> <s>A chatbot and home delivery will handle the queries those brokers once monopolised.</s> <s>Online application submission, the final step, remains under consideration.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>